#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:contract_line_lot_import.wizard_contract_line_lot_import
msgid ""
"Conditions:<br/>\n"
"                    - All fields are mandatory except P/N, but if S/N is provided, the corresponding P/N "
"must also be specified.<br/>\n"
"                    - If the contract, product, or lot does not exist, the system will try to create it, as "
"long as the required information is available.<br/>\n"
"                    - If more than one contract or product matches the same name or code, it will be "
"considered an error.<br/>\n"
"                    - If no contract line exists with the specified product, the lot cannot be assigned.<br/>"
msgstr ""

